					<h3>“God gave us all a purpose and mine is to ensure that everyone lives the healthiest and happiest lives possible!”</h3>
					<p>Dylan Gemelli is a recognized figure in the fitness and biohacking community. He is known by the monikers “The Wellness Revolutionary” and “The Aging Optimizer.”  Dylan hosts the Dylan Gemelli Podcast, where he engages with experts to explore health, wellness, biohacking as well as motivational discussions around overcoming adversity and becoming the best person, you can be.</p>
					<p>His efforts focus on enhancing life through advanced fitness and longevity methods. Dylan is currently pursuing a master's degree in dietetics and certifications in integrative and cellular health.  
As an educator on Hormone Optimization, Nutrition, and Strength Training, Dylan has grown his Instagram to over 1.5 million followers and runs successful YouTube channels, including his channel “Dylan Gemelli Biohacking” that is closing in on 100k subscribers.
</p>
                   <p>He launched “The Dylan Gemelli Podcast” at the start of 2025 and has already made a huge impact, getting to #1 in alternative health and as a mainstay in the top 10 in Health and Fitness on Apple.  He has hosted notable guests such as Dave Asprey, Ben Greenfield, Dr. Steven Gundry, Miesha Tate, Ben Azadi, J.J. Virgin, Adam Sosnick, Dr. David Jockers, Cynthia Thurlow and many more! Dylan also made his mark as a speaker at the 60th anniversary of Mr.Olympia in 2024 and will once again be speaking in 2025.  He has shared his impactful story on top rated podcasts as well, with Dr. David Jockers, J.J. Virgin, Dr. Daniel Pompa, Dr. Amie Hornaman, Mike “C Roc” Ciorrocco, Nathalie Niddam and is now on tour speaking with top podcast shows throughout the world! </p>
				   <p>Dylan is a God first family man that is set on doing God’s work, which for him, is helping everyone to live the healthiest and happiest lives possible!</p>
